Z||000032||artherd||11-18-2001||07:13 PM||||Good luck with your Ferrari-quest man!<P>308s and Mondials, etc. are probally at the lowest prices they will *ever* see.  The time is right, snag one before they become 'collector' cars and more expensive than houses!<P>Hope your Northstar goes to an enthusiest (I think it will  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> and hope you don't feel bad that your Ferrari isn't as fast  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>But oh god, the sound of a Ferrari V8 at full cam!!!    I think all of us are Ferrari nuts of one sort or another.  <P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">    <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red           &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
